config BR2_PACKAGE_UNIT_SIM
    bool "unit-sim (guest-side rawplay stand-in)"
    depends on BR2_USE_MMU
    depends on BR2_TOOLCHAIN_HAS_THREADS
    select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBUSB
    help
      unit-sim plays the car's rawplay on the wire inside a qemu guest: it
      enumerates the dummy_hcd gadget, validates LR MODE/FRAME messages,
      acks frames, sends the 1 s ready heartbeat, checks the mass-storage
      LUN mounts read-only, and records the T5/T6 boot milestones.

      It is a test instrument; leave it out of a release image.
